Type: Package
Package: LLMRpanel
Title: Benchmarked Silicon Samples for Survey and Experiment Design
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ali", "Sanaei", , "sanaei@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Administers survey and experimental instruments to panels of
  language-model personas, with respondent-level randomization, benchmark
  comparison against human data, and conjoint estimation from recorded
  respondent-level profile assignments.
